  "protocol": "Offline Bernoulli routing simulation using disjoint odd enrollment and even query pools. Query pool sampling is without replacement for each source; invalid responses consume calls but geometric scoring uses shared valid cells. No synthetic new API observations. Twenty fixed seeds share uniform masks across p. Seed 5th/95th percentiles describe finite-pool simulation variability, not independent-model confidence intervals. B evaluation is development resubstitution; S3 transfers B thresholds. All pairs are distinct declared labels; same-family pairs are not asserted to be ordered tier downgrades. Curves remain directed-pair weighted at all p; the separate genuine_frr column averages unique eligible reference labels, excluding subgroup singletons. At p=1 repeated reference scores are not independent trials.",
